            {
                "entry_id": "9297f620-3817-3a1f-b1b1-9a25865849c9",
                "word": "overmannen",
                "pos": "verb",
                "lang_code": "nl",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c83081d2-e1c8-3cc2-b1d0-6f725dadae37",
                        "entry_id": "9297f620-3817-3a1f-b1b1-9a25865849c9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "met grote kracht de baas worden of blijven"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "25f73efb-02fb-41ac-844f-f76891d86eb9",
                                "sense_id": "c83081d2-e1c8-3cc2-b1d0-6f725dadae37",
                                "text": "Andrea laat zich zelden overmannen door negatieve emoties. Dat heeft ze ook van haar vader: geen tijd verliezen, iets van je leven maken. ‘Bij ons thuis was er nooit een dood moment. Ik volgde piano- en balletles, ging zwemmen en trampolinespringen."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bf29d4eb-7c10-4878-8e37-e76d168332e8",
                                "sense_id": "c83081d2-e1c8-3cc2-b1d0-6f725dadae37",
                                "text": "Te beginnen met Zeus, die zich volgens de Griekse mythologie transformeerde in een witte stier teneinde de lieftallige jonge vrouw Europa te misleiden en overmannen - en die daarmee het latere continent op voorhand voorzag van een onheilspellend 'narratief'."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b824821e-cd3e-4e3b-9590-5c2d18a6a2e0",
                        "source_entry_id": "9297f620-3817-3a1f-b1b1-9a25865849c9",
                        "source_sense_id": "c83081d2-e1c8-3cc2-b1d0-6f725dadae37",
                        "source_sense_description": "met grote kracht de baas worden of blijven",
                        "target_lang_word": "overwhelm",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "overwhelm",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c1d88f48-8d54-36c4-b425-a9cfd1f960e9",
                                        "entry_id": "149ef4f8-840b-3208-be1e-2dc09ae9f331",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To engulf, surge over and submerge."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "da363f65-4e93-4303-b3e6-2f4d4e91e3c4",
                                                "sense_id": "c1d88f48-8d54-36c4-b425-a9cfd1f960e9",
                                                "text": "The dinghy was overwhelmed by the great wave."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "750064ee-7834-3a5a-9c49-e1b06ad471f9",
                                        "entry_id": "149ef4f8-840b-3208-be1e-2dc09ae9f331",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To overpower, crush."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a7940620-67de-4ad2-a93b-45a1be221f81",
                                                "sense_id": "750064ee-7834-3a5a-9c49-e1b06ad471f9",
                                                "text": "In December 1939 the Soviet Union attacked Finland with overwhelming force."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "86bd1cac-9cd5-400b-a69b-3a42c36f70c9",
                                                "sense_id": "750064ee-7834-3a5a-9c49-e1b06ad471f9",
                                                "text": "The sea overwhelmed their enemies."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4eb3661e-857e-3ae6-90b8-a9ff6ec1af5d",
                                        "entry_id": "149ef4f8-840b-3208-be1e-2dc09ae9f331",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To overpower emotionally."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "94d6cb9f-34b6-4a5f-8993-53e94d55e79b",
                                                "sense_id": "4eb3661e-857e-3ae6-90b8-a9ff6ec1af5d",
                                                "text": "He was overwhelmed with guilt."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0abe093a-2aa5-44bb-9e78-524cd14ce542",
                                                "sense_id": "4eb3661e-857e-3ae6-90b8-a9ff6ec1af5d",
                                                "text": "Joy overwhelmed her when she realized that she had won a million dollars."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a5567041-4e3b-44b4-8cab-76fb72e11eb7",
                                                "sense_id": "4eb3661e-857e-3ae6-90b8-a9ff6ec1af5d",
                                                "text": "Theon Greyjoy is the most well developed character on that stage, and the action comes down to him. Euron, with Yara underneath his ax, goads Theon into attack. But Theon is overwhelmed by the violence all around him, and instead he jumps overboard."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a08cac51-73c6-3238-8ab1-5bd877c03493",
                                        "entry_id": "149ef4f8-840b-3208-be1e-2dc09ae9f331",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To cause to surround, to cover."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8f0831ba-7ad6-4663-b675-421229d10760",
                                                "sense_id": "a08cac51-73c6-3238-8ab1-5bd877c03493",
                                                "text": "I lay Turpentine all over the same: then I overwhelm a broader pipe about the first"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "overwhelm",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2792b4f3-7271-3e2a-8bee-f1a02c71c51f",
                                        "entry_id": "8d49c231-3175-3afd-8629-6f6733d68dfc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state or condition of being overwhelmed."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dd19876b-2d92-4eff-a0ff-812f241d4070",
                                                "sense_id": "2792b4f3-7271-3e2a-8bee-f1a02c71c51f",
                                                "text": "If you beat your opponent by a margin of 5 or more, you have Overwhelmingly Succeeded. This type of success is often simply called an Overwhelm. […] An overwhelm means you've not only succeeded, but you've done something better than the average success would be."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8d08532b-85c2-4278-b14b-4183a5506c42",
                                                "sense_id": "2792b4f3-7271-3e2a-8bee-f1a02c71c51f",
                                                "text": "The fact is, that full permeation and understanding of an overwhelm or trauma makes it cease as an overwhelm or trauma."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4b786cfe-759f-4768-83f3-964cf4e8ded9",
                                                "sense_id": "2792b4f3-7271-3e2a-8bee-f1a02c71c51f",
                                                "text": "And what you’re feeling is normal in a dangerous situation — overwhelm and guilt when someone is harmed."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
